  unitName: Lord Jason (EU)
  unitId: 740143
  unitNumber: 7069
  description: Lord Jason of the Golden Highlands is a young warlord, a Noblesse
    able to transform into a powerful Ram. He has never encountered a foe that he
    was unable to knock out in one blow. Following his family tradition, he has just
    embarked on a journey to test his strength and to let the other Noblesse families
    keep in mind which one you never want to encounter on the battlefield.
  summonDesc: My journey for strength has just begun
  fusionDesc: Stronger. But so few worthy oponents...
